#: ../../source/guides/first-app/news_section.rst:66
msgid "Setting up Your Model"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/first-app/news_section.rst:68
msgid ""
"Instead of writing database operations right in the controller, queries "
"should be placed in a model, so they can easily be reused later. Models "
"are the place where you retrieve, insert, and update information in your "
"database or other data stores. They provide access to your data. You can "
"read more about it in :doc:`../../models/model`."
msgstr ""

